    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market with Richard Mulhall of RE/MAX Partners, 118 Beech Park is a\r\nthree-bedroom semi-detached home in truly immaculate, condition. This home has a green certificate and B energy rating.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of a hallway featuring contemporary flooring \r\nrunning through the hall and sitting room with a  bright and \r\nspacious open plan kitchen / dining room overlooking the rear garden to the rear.  A guest w/c completes downstairs. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, two double and a single with the  principal bedroom ensuite and a family bathroom \r\nOutside, the property continues to impress. The front of this home has parking for two cars and to the rear is a private garden with lawn and patio—an ideal space for outdoor \r\nentertaining.\r\n\r\nVery well located , Beech Park is within easy walking distance of \r\nlocal schools, shops, and Leixlip village, with good access to public transport links, train and bus and a short drive to the M4 motorway.\r\n\r\nAn exceptional property throughout – early viewing of this home is strongly advised!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nHALLWAY: c.3.77 x 1.14m\r\nLight fittings, wooden floor, phone point.\r\n\r\nLOUNGE: c.4.79 x 3.96m\r\nLight fittings, electric feature fireplace, TV/cable point, curtains, blinds, wooden floor, features a bay window.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM: c.3.06 x 5.21 & 1.35 x 2.51m\r\nLight fittings, fitted units, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, area plumbed, French double doors leading to garden/ patio area, Velux window, \r\nTV/cable point, blinds, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nSTORAGE ROOM: c.0.78 x 2.51m\r\nLight fittings, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nGUEST WC: c.1.52 x 1.53m\r\nLight fitting, extractor fan, WC, WHB, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLANDING: c.3.48 x 1.10m\r\nLight fitting, hot press, attic access, carpet.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1: c.3.08 x 4.62m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, blinds, curtains, TV/cable point.\r\n\r\nENSUITE: c.1.46 x 1.85m\r\nLight fittings, extractor fan, fully tiled, cubicle with mains shower, WC, WHB.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2: c.4.25 x 2.95m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, features a bay window, blinds, curtains, carpet,  features bay window.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3: c.3.44 x 2.22m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, blinds, curtains, carpet.\r\n\r\nBATHRROM: c.1.95 x 1.84m\r\nLight fitting, extractor fan, floor & wall tiling, WC, WHB, electric shower over bath."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "INTERNAL FEATURES\r\nAll curtains and carpets included in sale\r\nAll blinds included in sale\r\nAll light fittings included in sale\r\nProperty fully alarmed\r\nSome appliances included in sale\r\n\r\nEXTERNAL FEATURES\r\nWooden double glazed windows\r\nPVC facia and soffits\r\nOutside tap\r\nOutside light\r\nPatio area\r\nLandscaped gardens\r\nSide gates\r\nCobble lock driveway\r\nBarna shed\r\nOnsite parking\r\n\r\nSERVICES/HEATING:\t\r\nMains water \r\nMains sewerage\r\nG.F.C.H\r\n\r\nFLOOR AREA: c.109.41 sq. mtrs.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY AGE: 2005\r\n\r\nBER RATING: B\r\n\r\nBER NUMBER: 119855815\r\n\r\nMANAGEMENT FEES: €270 p.a.\r\n\r\nDISCLOSURE: All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permission for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct but any intending purchaser or tenant should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy himself/herself by inspection or    otherwise as to the correctness of each of them."
